# docs/ is PUBLIC and holds USER documentation only — an allowlist, not a blocklist.
# Internal development notes belong in the private tallyst-docs repository, never here.
# Why an allowlist: the patterns above are root-anchored (a leading `/`), so anything
# placed under docs/ slipped past them — which is exactly how a handoff, a plan, the
# decisions log and the backlog ended up sitting in a public repo, untracked but one
# `git add -A` away from being published. Anything new in docs/ is ignored unless it is
# named here on purpose.
/docs/*
!/docs/INSTALL.md
!/docs/images/

# The same families anywhere in the tree, not just at the root (no leading `/`).
HANDOFF-*.md
PLAN-*.md
*-DIAGNOSIS.md
ROADMAP.md
decisions.md
backlog.md
/demo_content/arca-demo-spec.md
/demo_content/arca-blog-expanded-1.md
/demo_content/arca-blog-expanded-2.md
